  "prefLabel": "Csp 102.05 Quarterly Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 102.05 Quarterly Meetings. Quarterly meetings of the commission shall be held at such time and in such month as shall be fixed by the chairperson. The commission shall provide notice of the time and place for each meeting of the commission and conduct such meetings in accordance with RSA 91-A:2.\n\nSource. #7082, eff 8-26-99; ss by #9583, eff 11-2-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/csp100-700.html"
